  "description": "Seo Ji-woon goes to pay his respects at the funeral of his team leader's father—who is also his boyfriend and a colleague—only to discover that he is a married man. Enraged by the fact that he was someone's lover, he resolves to find a better man; just then, he makes eye contact with his colleague Shin Jae-on… and time stops as if by magic!\n\n[Congratulations! You two have been selected as the first pilot couple for the [Humanity Preservation Plan]!] [MISSION: Reactivate the world through physical contact with the target.]\n\nCan't leave if I don't complete the mission? Here? At my ex-boyfriend's father's funeral?! More importantly, we… are both men…!!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082244)",
